onstruction:** Converts patient CT and endoscopic data into high-fidelity ear models.\n* **Procedures:** Simulates **grommet insertion**, **tympanoplasty**, and **cholesteatoma removal**.\n\n## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Core Technology\n* **SurgMotion Kinematics:** Tracks hand trajectory, velocity, and economy of motion against expert benchmarks.\n* **Cloud & Scalable Architecture:** Enables remote supervision and expansion from ENT to respiratory, digestive, nervous, and musculoskeletal systems.\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Upcoming Releases\n* **Haptic Gloves:** Force-feedback hardware for real tissue resistance and tool weight.\n* **SurgiVideoRAG AI:** Video understanding and RAG for automated performance review and Q&A.\n\n## \ud83d\udccc Summary\nSurgiVerse converts clinical scans into validated VR training modules. It currently scores skills via SurgMotion, with haptic gloves and SurgiVideoRAG advancing toward a multi-specialty ecosystem.\n", "short_description": "SurgiVerse is an immersive virtual reality (VR) surgical training platform replacing scarce cadaveric practice with safe, measurable simulations for medical schools and hospitals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://surgiverse-web.vercel.app/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CopticTech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://surgiverse-web.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], 